# Normalize line endings. core.autocrlf is true at SYSTEM scope on this
# machine (Git for Windows installer default), which nobody chose. This
# repo serves davidfacer.com, the practice's primary public surface, and
# it is the repo a conformance sweep reads to answer what the site is --
# so line-ending churn here costs review attention on the one diff that
# is read most often. Added 2026-09-17 UTC.
#
# public/index.html was the single CRLF file in the index and is
# renormalized in the same commit, so this file does not leave a latent
# diff waiting for whoever next touches it.
* text=auto
